115. FINAL REPORT

The assignment asks for:

Agent ID
Agent Name
Agent City
Salary
Incentive
Total Earnings
Hub Name
Hub City
Supervisor Name
Agent Status

and sorting by hub name, then total earnings descending.

SELECT
    da.agent_id AS Agent_ID,
    da.agent_name AS Agent_Name,
    da.city AS Agent_City,
    da.salary AS Salary,
    da.incentive AS Incentive,
    da.salary + da.incentive AS Total_Earnings,
    dh.hub_name AS Hub_Name,
    dh.city AS Hub_City,
    sup.agent_name AS Supervisor_Name,
    da.status AS Agent_Status
FROM delivery_agents da
LEFT JOIN delivery_hubs dh
ON da.hub_id = dh.hub_id
LEFT JOIN delivery_agents sup
ON da.supervisor_id = sup.agent_id
ORDER BY dh.hub_name, Total_Earnings DESC;